flowchart TD
    A[Frontend tick<br/>realtime_serving_frontend.cpp] --> B[process_pim_callbacks]
    B --> C[maybe_complete_active_task]
    C --> D{waiting admission queue enabled?}

    D -->|Yes| E[enqueue_arrivals_up_to_now]
    E --> F{SLO guarded admission?}
    F -->|Yes| G[process_slo_guarded_admission_queue]
    F -->|No| H[process_admission_queue]

    D -->|No| I[admit_arrivals_up_to_now]

    G --> J[maybe_start_next_task]
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K[choose_next_task inside maybe_start_next_task]
    K --> L{task selected?}
    L -->|No| M[pump_active_pim_job if active task exists]
    L -->|Yes| N[reserve hybrid task memory]
    N --> O{allocation succeeds?}
    O -->|No| P[hold / allocator rebind path]
    O -->|Yes| Q[start_task]

    P --> M
    Q --> M

    M --> R[pump_active_pim_job]
    R --> S[maybe_complete_active_task]
    S --> T[debug / progress logging]
    T --> U{try_fast_forward?}
    U -->|Yes| V[advance m_clk to next event]
    U -->|No| W[m_clk plus plus]
    V --> X[next tick]
    W --> X
